sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Qt UI (DetectionPage)
    participant DS as DetectionService
    participant TR as TransactionRepository
    participant AD as AnomalyDetector
    participant DR as DetectionRepository

    UI->>DS: analyzeAll(analyzedCount, flaggedCount)
    DS->>TR: getAllTransactions()
    TR-->>DS: List~Transaction~
    DS->>AD: analyze(transactions)
    AD-->>DS: List~DetectionResult~
    DS->>DR: saveResults(results, analyzedIds)
    DR-->>DS: ok / error
    DS-->>UI: analyzedCount, flaggedCount, results
